{
  "id": 442114755,
  "iid": 22876,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "req_resp_hdrs: Pass the desegment condition into tvb_find_line_end",
  "description": "We can only desegment if the buffer is not truncated. Pass that\ncondition into tvb_find_line_end instead of testing it afterwards.\nIn the case where the buffer is truncated, this causes tvb_find_line_end\nto return the captured length remaining instead of -1, which is better\nfor passing to tvb_get_string_enc. It has the same result as when -1\nfor the end of the [captured] buffer was allowed.\n\nCoverity CID 1676195\n\nAlso, change two places where packet-http and packet-rtsp programmatically\nleft the reported_length as -1 when not found in a packet, and depended\non tvb_new_subset_length treating -1 as meaning \"to the end of the\npacket.\"",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-12-21T00:53:51.015Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-12-21T02:22:59.245Z",
